0rs5nlrhd","Telegram Android widget 安全过滤器可被两种方式绕过并实现 RCE","NebuSec 披露了 Telegram for Android 13.2.2 (7303) 新增 widget 安全过滤器的两种绕过方式：利用过滤器未覆盖的 widget 漏洞，以及串联过滤器覆盖的 widget 漏洞与内核漏洞，研究人员在测试服务器上演示代码越过过滤器并启动手机计算器。","The Hacker News","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/researchers-claim-two-rce-exploits-that.html","2026-11-17T19:34:20.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/3d21685a726d0a64.jpg","/dailyinfo/media/a1e7de8b6809b50e.jpg 48w, /dailyinfo/media/3d21685a726d0a64.jpg 96w","fqo8gu0aw8gwmfm6rhttlqokf","Siemens 15 款工业自动化软件受 CVE-2026-111497 影响，CVSS 9.8","Siemens 15 款工业自动化软件受 Node.js Brotli 解码器越界写漏洞 CVE-2026-111497 影响，CVSS v3.1 为 9.8，远程未认证攻击者可造成内存破坏、敏感信息泄露、拒绝服务或潜在执行任意代码。","CISA 安全公告","https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/ics-advisories/icsa-26-321-03","2026-11-17T12:00:00.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/c65213b8bb0b8c32.webp","/dailyinfo/media/f4741f74a4c97912.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/c65213b8bb0b8c32.webp 96w","followUp","en85jqoawywbih6ciysura11w","Apple iOS 麦克风权限绕过漏洞 CVE-2026-65339 技术分析","研究人员披露 Apple 音频服务漏洞 CVE-2026-65339 的技术细节，应用可在用户拒绝麦克风权限后继续录音，部分测试版本的橙色麦克风指示灯不会亮起。","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/researchers-detail-iphone-flaw-that-let.html","2026-11-17T12:14:36.000Z","t3l0ju6zlyroz3zo0x438qj82","研究人员发现 Docker Hub 公开镜像中的云密钥最快 7.86 秒被窃取","Stony Brook University 研究人员在 8 个公共容器仓库发布 300 个蜜罐镜像，测得公开镜像中的 AWS、OpenAI 和 Anthropic 凭据会遭自动化扫描器提取利用。","BleepingComputer","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/cloud-keys-leaked-in-docker-hub-images-are-stolen-within-seconds/","2026-11-17T21:27:17.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/198a4d86de90e233.webp","/dailyinfo/media/3a544a742516b0af.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/198a4d86de90e233.webp 96w","fcygdwsq0sdizweg2my9t8a2n","TGR-STA-0049以HTTP/3 RAT攻击东南亚政府机构并窃取敏感数据","Unit 42 发现 TGR-STA-0049 至少自 2025 年 7 月起针对东南亚政府机构的网络间谍活动，攻击者利用未修补的 Microsoft Exchange 服务器和 Web 服务器部署 Web Shell，并通过伪装成政府文件的 PDF 投递 PerfectPioneer RAT。","Unit 42","https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/custom-rats-target-southeast-asia-governments/","2026-11-16T23:00:55.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/4d373ddb2d54a219.webp","/dailyinfo/media/c5c35eb93d4d2e80.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/4d373ddb2d54a219.webp 96w","f8ncv2a1cko0q6hhiockby3pz","Microsoft 揭示设备码钓鱼对 GitHub Copilot CLI 代理的四类影响","Microsoft 以 GitHub Copilot CLI 为例说明，攻击者诱使用户批准设备码授权后，可在实验环境中远程操控已启用远程控制的会话、植入误导性记忆、读取云同步会话及访问私有仓库。","Microsoft Security Blog","https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/security/blog/2026/11/17/the-risks-of-device-code-authentication-for-ai-coding-agents/","2026-11-17T15:00:00.000Z","vk1sqw9r2vpu5keky20h61mo3","Microsoft 365 全球中断期间出现高量级协同钓鱼活动","Microsoft 确认全球出现一场利用 Microsoft 365 服务中断实施的高量级协同钓鱼活动，邮件冒充服务健康通知，诱导用户点击恶意链接并提交凭据。服务中断于 November 12 11.20 EST 开始，持续超过 22 小时，November 13 23.15 EST 全面恢复。","Infosecurity Magazine","https://www.infosecurity-magazine.com/news/microsoft-phishing-service-outage/","2026-11-17T13:00:00.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/b3cc9cd29f272a5a.webp","/dailyinfo/media/6406d1b57afc7303.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/b3cc9cd29f272a5a.webp 96w","otherSources","x0nfqulcxfxxefb4ym9510pen","Trigram 冒充约 50 个 AI 与区块链品牌，用信息窃取器攻击开发者","Trigram 冒充欧洲和美国约 50 个 AI、区块链品牌，以招聘、会议邀请和包裹追踪场景诱导开发者执行信息窃取器，并借助被篡改的代码仓库实施软件供应链入侵。","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/trigram-campaign-impersonates-about-50.html","2026-11-17T15:17:28.000Z","jzchu55e6wyzqizb1khip70u4","ConnectWise 警告 SCKit 持续攻击未修补的 ScreenConnect 环境","ConnectWise 表示，ScreenConnect 26.6.5 之前的客户端存在 CVSS 9.9 的漏洞 CVE-2026-84869，未禁用相关第三方扩展的本地部署仍在遭受攻击。","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/connectwise-warns-screenconnect-attacks.html","2026-11-17T06:29:27.000Z","related",[230],{"_146":231,"_47":232,"_149":-5,"_151":233,"_153":234,"_155":235,"_157":236,"_159":237,"_161":162,"_163":164},"tz4xdt33pmmjfiz82kro43q09","ConnectWise ScreenConnect 遭 CVE-2026-84869 在野利用，42 台 MSP 服务器受影响","SecurityWeek","https://www.securityweek.com/msp-screenconnect-servers-targeted-in-month-long-campaign/","2026-11-17T13:24:43.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/6f21a015ea489b81.webp","/dailyinfo/media/c2a91b85de7bb9d6.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/6f21a015ea489b81.webp 96w",{"_241":301,"_149":-5,"_243":302},{"_241":260,"_149":-5,"_243":261},{"_241":242,"_149":-5,"_243":244},"label","AI 安全","items",[245,246],{"_146":252,"_47":253,"_149":254,"_151":255,"_153":256,"_155":257,"_157":258,"_159":259,"_161":162,"_163":164},{"_146":247,"_47":248,"_149":249,"_151":190,"_153":250,"_155":251,"_157":193,"_159":194,"_161":162,"_163":164},"jk2xf7q2h1rx5r54g5jr1b34s","研究人员接管 Hugging Face 上 Kokoro 模型账户并演示模型投毒","研究人员因 Hugging Face 缺少发布者所有权验证，通过注册原所有者公开域名并重置密码接管 Kokoro 账户。团队在本地通过修改模型权重，使相同输入文本生成与原文不一致的音频，87 秒即可完成，且未改动推理代码、上传恶意代码或改变发布者外观。","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/researchers-hijack-hugging-face-account-for-popular-kokoro-ai-model/","2026-11-17T18:21:24.000Z","uhzyjjwx5bm5fi1uht55ekcqo","Google Threat Intelligence Group 发现 AI agent 无人操作即编写并发起漏洞利用","Google Threat Intelligence Group 与 Mandiant 披露，威胁行为者已让 AI agent 在入侵中独立完成部分环节：GTIG 在过去一个季度首次看到有攻击者用 LLM 框架在无人参与的情况下自动完成漏洞发现与利用。","Help Net Security","https://www.helpnetsecurity.com/2026/11/17/ai-powered-cyberattacks-gtig-report/","2026-11-17T08:45:24.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/06c9ab9de6dbb6a5.webp","/dailyinfo/media/9c1b5fa87b3bafc5.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/06c9ab9de6dbb6a5.webp 96w","攻击与威胁",[262,263,264,265,266],{"_146":296,"_47":297,"_149":298,"_151":283,"_153":299,"_155":300,"_157":286,"_159":287,"_161":162,"_163":164,"_217":56},{"_146":288,"_47":289,"_149":290,"_151":291,"_153":292,"_155":293,"_157":294,"_159":295,"_161":162,"_163":164},{"_146":280,"_47":281,"_149":282,"_151":283,"_153":284,"_155":285,"_157":286,"_159":287,"_161":162,"_163":164,"_217":42},{"_146":275,"_47":276,"_149":277,"_151":168,"_153":278,"_155":279,"_157":171,"_159":172,"_161":162,"_163":164},{"_146":267,"_47":268,"_149":269,"_151":270,"_153":271,"_155":272,"_157":273,"_159":274,"_161":162,"_163":164},"nzt95o0rx92hlv2bv6ms960qe","Google Cloud 披露 COLD RELIC 利用云身份连续入侵两起美国机构事件","Google Cloud 披露俄罗斯国家级组织 COLD RELIC 通过钓鱼、住宅代理和 MFA 疲劳攻击入侵两家美国机构，并利用前一家窃取的人员与关系数据冒充员工，攻击第二家的 Microsoft Entra ID。","Google Cloud 威胁情报","https://cloud.google.com/blog/topics/threat-intelligence/cold-relic-a-case-study-in-impersonation-and-compromise/","2026-11-17T14:00:00.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/424bd6373c2d87d6.webp","/dailyinfo/media/9a88f7a6491d815b.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/424bd6373c2d87d6.webp 96w","gs8rcycdyebhht60u2ulltq7n","Kaspersky 披露 Operation ShadowCloud 利用 GitHub 和 SharePoint 部署 GitDoor、GraphDoor 后门","Kaspersky 披露 Operation ShadowCloud 在亚洲和非洲政府部门开展的网络入侵活动，利用合法 MeshAgent 植入此前未记录的 GitDoor 和 GraphDoor 后门，并通过 GitHub、Microsoft SharePoint 和 Ably 隐藏 C2 流量、动态下载插件和内存 shellcode。","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/new-gitdoor-and-graphdoor-backdoors.html","2026-11-17T11:20:18.000Z","qbdg7b3a2508pllcfj3cllxpi","Fireworks AI 凭据泄露导致 Uber 近 149,346 名用户数据被窃","攻击者使用已泄露的 Fireworks AI 内部凭据访问 Uber 外部环境，窃取近 149,346 名用户的姓名、家庭住址、出生日期、驾照号码、驾照及政府签发身份证件图片。","Security Affairs","https://securityaffairs.com/203339/data-breach/fireworks-ai-breach-exposes-uber-data-and-highlights-supply-chain-risks.html","2026-11-17T19:11:20.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/ef2b2b57fb06e54f.webp","/dailyinfo/media/2adef5b1e4357a03.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/ef2b2b57fb06e54f.webp 96w","j7nnva1vm6p3lhh17mhlx0wfn","FBI 披露 ARTEX AI 框架将攻击提权时间压缩至 3 小时以内","FBI 称，攻击者自 2026 年 8 月起使用开源 AI 框架 ARTEX 攻击全球金融服务、政府、科技、国防、医疗、半导体、能源、制造、电信和法律服务等行业，可借助多个 AI agents 自动完成目标发现、弱点检查、漏洞利用和数据外传，部分攻击在不到 3 小时内获得特权访问。","Hackread","https://hackread.com/fbi-artex-ai-tool-hackers-gain-privileged-access/","2026-11-17T16:51:49.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/dd06beac4cadc6f3.webp","/dailyinfo/media/47417cbef4636b7b.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/dd06beac4cadc6f3.webp 96w","cpozl5byqasqocx0exg64utib","攻击者劫持 Optimizely Web Experimentation 脚本，178 家组织网站遭注入","攻击者利用 Optimizely Web Experimentation 漏洞，将恶意 JavaScript 注入 178 家组织的项目，影响 Zoom、BBC、CNN、Salesforce、GitLab、IKEA、HSBC、Equifax 等网站。","https://securityaffairs.com/203289/malware/optimjack-bbc-cnn-and-zoom-among-targets-of-optimizely-script-hijacking.html","2026-11-17T09:38:44.000Z","漏洞与在野利用",[303,304,305,306,307],{"_146":110,"_47":99,"_149":340,"_151":190,"_153":341,"_155":342,"_157":193,"_159":194,"_161":162,"_163":164,"_217":42,"_228":343},{"_146":325,"_47":326,"_149":327,"_151":328,"_153":329,"_155":330,"_157":-5,"_161":164,"_163":164,"_217":42,"_228":331},{"_146":321,"_47":322,"_149":323,"_151":176,"_153":324,"_155":178,"_157":179,"_159":180,"_161":164,"_163":164},{"_146":313,"_47":314,"_149":315,"_151":316,"_153":317,"_155":318,"_157":319,"_159":320,"_161":164,"_163":164},{"_146":308,"_47":309,"_149":310,"_151":168,"_153":311,"_155":312,"_157":171,"_159":172,"_161":162,"_163":164},"s1eozdkmwspk9y4hui1ujvnfi","N-able 修复 N-central 17 个漏洞，既有漏洞已被用于部署加密货币矿工","N-able 为 N-central 2026.4 Hotfix 3 修复 17 个安全漏洞，涉及本地权限提升、认证绕过、XML 外部实体注入、SSRF、路径遍历和 RCE 等问题。","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/n-able-patches-17-n-central-flaws-as.html","2026-11-17T05:00:34.000Z","cxpqkath9so8ongzhll7oibqa","Chrome 158 稳定版发布，修复 204 项安全问题","Google 将 Chrome 158 推送至 Windows、Mac 和 Linux 稳定渠道，版本为 Linux 158.0.8127.36、Windows/Mac 158.0.8127.36/.37，更新将在未来数日或数周内逐步推出。","Chrome Releases","http://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2026/11/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_01699533288.html","2026-11-17T19:12:07.339Z","/dailyinfo/media/2804b677dd1e2bc0.webp","/dailyinfo/media/a673d47722466a30.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/2804b677dd1e2bc0.webp 96w","g0z2h9egt3off5o39j4avh9cu","Siemens 28 个工业软件产品受 Google Brotli 缓冲区溢出漏洞影响","Google Brotli 1.0.3 至 1.2.0 的解码器 c/dec/decode.c 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程未认证攻击者可利用特制 Brotli 压缩流破坏内存、泄露敏感内容、导致拒绝服务，或可能执行任意代码。","https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/ics-advisories/icsa-26-321-04","mg2hvvx1gkkrqp4l17mvgnrr8","奇安信 CERT 复现 LibreOffice 远程代码执行漏洞 CVE-2026-104692、CVE-2026-104007","奇安信 CERT 已复现 LibreOffice 远程代码执行漏洞 CVE-2026-104692、CVE-2026-104007，攻击者可通过特制 ODS 文档在用户打开时实现任意代码执行，无需宏警告或额外交互。","奇安信 CERT","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU5NDgxODU1MQ==&mid=2247508132&idx=1&sn=765cffd533b8087793a59834cabdc0dd","2026-11-17T09:06:00.000Z",[332],{"_146":333,"_47":334,"_149":-5,"_151":335,"_153":336,"_155":337,"_157":338,"_159":339,"_161":162,"_163":164},"crfev8jw3i08f5o0i83y4l4v1","LibreOffice RCE 利用链分析：CVE-2026-104692 与 CVE-2026-104007","Sec-News 安全文摘","https://govuln.com/news/url/dbVX","2026-11-17T03:12:33.663Z","/dailyinfo/media/d2ca541f851c1107.webp","/dailyinfo/media/03390883e3e7efa3.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/d2ca541f851c1107.webp 96w","OpenJDK 的 Java4Shell 漏洞 CVE-2026-114938 可被未认证攻击者用于 RCE，并可能泄露内存敏感信息。该内存破坏缺陷影响 OpenJDK 17.0.6 及之后版本，Calif 评为 CVSS 4.0 9.2，Oracle 评为 CVSS 3.1 8.1（High）。","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/critical-java4shell-flaw-allows-rce-attacks-on-major-java-applications/","2026-11-17T23:04:21.000Z",[344],{"_146":345,"_47":346,"_149":-5,"_151":176,"_153":347,"_155":178,"_157":179,"_159":180,"_161":164,"_163":164},"rqea4z2nhncrkf2s1jvtvp067","Oracle Java Base64 解码器漏洞 CVE-2026-114938 存在未认证 RCE，CISA 要求立即修补","https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/alerts/2026/11/17/critical-java-vulnerability-requires-immediate-patching",{"_146":296,"_47":297,"_149":298,"_151":283,"_153":299,"_155":300,"_157":286,"_159":287,"_161":162,"_163":164,"_217":56},{"_146":325,"_47":326,"_149":327,"_151":328,"_153":329,"_155":330,"_157":-5,"_161":164,"_163":164,"_217":42,"_228":351},{"_146":321,"_47":322,"_149":323,"_151":176,"_153":324,"_155":178,"_157":179,"_159":180,"_161":164,"_163":164},[352],{"_146":333,"_47":334,"_149":-5,"_151":335,"_153":336,"_155":337,"_157":338,"_159":339,"_161":162,"_163":164},"leadParagraph",{"_355":356,"_357":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
